repository-code: https://github.com/VyapakBansal/libeventgate
url: https://github.com/VyapakBansal/libeventgate
abstract: CUDA/TensorRT pipeline for IMU-gated event-to-video reconstruction on a pure EVS camera. An ARE-style gyroscope test holds FireNet reconstructions during standstill, using a 1 s fade-horizon latch on the last high-event frame.
keywords:
  - event camera
  - event-to-video
  - FireNet
  - zero-velocity detection
  - IMU
  - TensorRT
